<title>FRANCE: Paribas no comment on Bancaire sale talk.</title>
<headline>Paribas no comment on Bancaire sale talk.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas said it had no comment on a recurrent market rumour that it was negotiating the sale of its Cie Bancaire unit.</p>
<p>Market sources mentioned U.S. General Electric as a possible buyer.</p>
<p>Cie Bancaire was up 3.33 percent at 682 francs while Paribas was up 2.04 percent at 375 francs at 1529 GMT.</p>
</text>
